    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Interesting, a Perro blocking an attack for a Sarkaz... Neither of you is getting away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ezell, you stay put. Don't you even think about\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No funny business, I know. The terminal is on, Miss Fiammetta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Trust me, all I care about is ensuring Cecelia's safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Change of plans. You can't stay here. Take Cecelia to the Basilica right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_300_phenxi_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's more dangerous for us to stay in the open like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fiammetta"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Weren't we going to the big statue? This is the wrong way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're taking a little detour.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's a detour?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It means we're going somewhere else right now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Ecclesia Requietum.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
