    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "A Sarkaz.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I planned to ask Miss Fiammetta for a favor after we reached the Basilica.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "To have a high-ranking executor look after her, or the Pontifica Cohors to protect her...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And confirm that Cecelia poses no threat to Laterano...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "To let Cecelia see her mother Feoria one more time before she's interred.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But, a Sarkaz.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "If Cecelia's father is a Sarkaz... then she should also be a Sarkaz.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And yet she still has a halo...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "...I might be dreaming.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "If Cecelia was nothing more than another 'exception'...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But she is a Sarkaz...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "How could a Sarkaz with a halo be allowed to leave the Basilica?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Even if... even if the worst doesn't befall her...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "How would she ever be allowed to leave?",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "......",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Even if this gets me expelled from the Notarial Hall, I have to try.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I must bring Cecelia to the Ecclesia Requietum.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And at least let her say goodbye.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
