        "text": "I managed to keep him from killing me, only for you to very nearly do me in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hard to forget something like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And that's the reason you always wear a hat in front of me? Doesn't it get uncomfortable?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been a Legata for this long already. It's just a hat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And as for you, you should probably let sleeping beasts lie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you resent me, Mostima?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Laterano has always needed the Lateran Curia to keep things going, and that's always rubbed some people the wrong way. So I don't really care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we have a little misunderstanding. That few fallen angels remain in the Church has nothing to do with the Church itself, but rather the Sankta nature of those fallen angels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My attitude may be a bit peculiar, but... do you not deem yourself an aberration?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Considering the way you're talking to me, aren't you afraid I'll become one of those 'regular fallen angels'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If that was a possibility, I wouldn't be 'talking to you that way' in the first place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine. Let's talk business first. When's Fiammetta getting transferred?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing good's gonna come out of her sticking to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't you be asking her instead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#10$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Brought it up before. No good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#10$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And you think I'd have a better shot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks to me like the convenient part of power is you get to ignore what other people want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a price to be paid for that... So let's hear it. Why do you want Fiammetta transferred?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She said she was my escort. Are you guys not curious as to what needs escorting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, there are some who think she's a warden or jailer to a fallen angel like me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And they don't know the first thing about Fiammetta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just the bait she's using to get at Andoian.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sure she'd be terribly hurt if she heard you say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I'll try saying it another way... the bait is the Lock and Key I'm carrying on my back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And? What's wrong with letting Fiammetta do as she pleases? If she can get rid of Andoain or even capture him and bring him back to the Basilica, I'd be very pleased.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Or are you saying that even the two of you together can't catch Andoain?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not necessarily. As long as Andoain is still fixated on the Lock and Key, he can't escape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But... let me think.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What if Andoain has already found another path?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#6$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What really sucks is I've moved on. Lemuen has moved on. Maybe even Andoain has moved on... But Fiammetta is still trapped in that rainy night eight years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way I could bring that up with Fiammetta.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's times like these where I start to miss that good old empathy...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh wait, Fiammetta is a Liberi anyway. Wouldn't do me any good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#10$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This conversation sure brings me back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#7$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What, are you here to share the wisdom of one who has walked that path?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you'll allow me to exercise my authority as an elder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#5$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "By all means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember what you said to me eight years ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to ruin the moment we're having, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, Your Holiness. I can't say that I do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#9$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It was, 'No... I still have things to do, and people to protect.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Velliv's impression of me is making my skin crawl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_361_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_213_mostma_1#11$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Velliv"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You weren't willing to let me choose for you. So why, now, do you need to choose for Fiammetta?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_356_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Each must find her own path. She must find it, and then traverse it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vel, this is my same answer to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "The Pope"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
