    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "26_g5_laterano_chapelout",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$drift_intro",
        "key": "$drift_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're almost there, Cecelia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry I'm so slow, Mister Ezell... The sun is about to go behind the mountain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're doing a great job! Even though we can't use public transit, we're almost off the plate. If I were as strong as Miss Fiammetta, you wouldn't have to work so hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's okay! Actually, Mamma took me out once and we went somewhere far, far away from home... just like here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, won't Miss Fiammetta find out that we sneaked out here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If she's only looking for my terminal's signal... then hopefully that will buy me a little bit of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "The important thing is that we're here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this where Mamma went?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia... I've been thinking about how to explain this to you for a long time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Feoria, your mama... is here. But she's also not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no way of letting you see your mama again, but at least you'll be able to say goodbye to her here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell... I don't think I get... what you're saying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If she's here, but she's also not, does that mean... she went somewhere else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did she go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's head in first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "26_g6_laterano_chapelin",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Before my father passed away, he always hoped there would be nothing but smiles at his funeral. That we'd see no tears. But, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If I may, I believe what your esteemed father truly wished was for you not to fall into grief over his passing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Prioress"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether through tears or laughter, if that is your way of sending him off... then I'm sure he will gladly accept your sentiments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Prioress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you... Seniora Prioress...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Citizen"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_368_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_369_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Allow me to accompany you around the flower fields outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Warm Prioress"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell, that lady also said that her father 'passed away'...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... People who pass away all come here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "People who are alive come to send them off... And after that, they carry on the wishes of the person who passed away, and continue on with life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what about the people who passed away? What do they do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#12$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe... they're watching us from up high in the sky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So we won't be able to see them again because they went into the sky?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Cecelia, this is for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is... Mamma's guardian gun?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mama and papa were both executors for the Notarial Hall. I didn't see them much when I was little... and it was my nonno who raised me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Nonno really loved his gun, and he'd tell me stories about his younger days every time he polished it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "He told me about the battles he fought, his friends, how he met my nonna, and the embarrassing things my papa did as a kid...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I saw my nonno's gun, I would think back to the stories he told me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Later, my nonno passed away. I was only a little older than you are now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "An executor from the Notarial Hall came and took away his guardian gun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how I was supposed to take away your mama's gun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$distressed_intro",
        "key": "$distressed_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Ezell slowly crouches down and places Feoria's gun in Cecelia's hand."
    },
    {
        "text": "She lowers her head and looks at her mother's patron firearm."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ezell gently holds Cecelia's hand."
    },
    {
        "text": "Warm drops of water fall onto the embossed floral pattern of the patron firearm's grip, collecting into a little pool in the young girl's palms."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Ezell... Why am I crying...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I watered the plants in the backyard every week, just like my nonno had taught me. When they blossomed, I was very happy and called for him to come and see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4036_forcer_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_352_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But it was only when I called for him that I realized he wasn't there anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would never see my nonno again, or his gun.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "text": "Death is the last goodbye you'll ever say to someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ezell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_352_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Cecelia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.7,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, to say goodbye is to overcome death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "For there to be a 'goodbye,' the living must move forward while the dead stay behind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "A 'goodbye' is the longing that the living have for the dead. It is proof that the dead lived.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_351_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And that is why we must say goodbye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friar"
    },
